    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not a \"transition\" though. you don't get to come back from this. my reputation is radioactive. the people i used to lead, the people i loved... they don't even look me in the eye. i've lost the only version of myself that mattered. there's no \"strength underneath\" because there's nothing left to build on. it's just total, permanent silence.",
